-> HAS_FACET [node:be297a51-6cb1-4526-bdb5-c01badf562a2] @ 2026-09-08T09:38:00.810299+00:00
-> ABOUT [node:f2e09a03-8e61-4299-ad7c-cef6c06775fe] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:13.159299+00:00

SQLite is the database engine, chosen because the whole system is one machine on a LAN. Only the access layer is still open - the migration adapter and query builder must fit the hexagonal architecture (the repository is swappable behind a port) and a TypeScript-first stack; Drizzle, Kysely and better-sqlite3 are the candidates, not the decision.
