[node:012f356c-2e3e-4fe4-9388-38f089198a41]
type: decision
tier: lifetime
path: /artifact/a-v2-of-the-theme-schema-exists-as-a-str
created_at: 2026-09-08T09:38:29.877767+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:73fb6132-40d3-4e2d-8b88-334442c4bfa7] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:09.672544+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:79662ce5-7b55-458a-b0e9-f0efd406d5a8] @ 2026-09-08T09:38:29.877767+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-08T09:38:29.877767+00:00

A v2 of the theme schema exists as a strict superset of v1 - every current theme file still validates - adding a night mode alongside light and dark, the border, strong-border, signal, warn, focus and accent-foreground roles, explicit hover and active states, the two-tier type scale, spacing, control heights, motion, and a night-mode schedule. It is generated from a canonical theme file that annotates every role with provenance (kept, fixed, or new) and its measured contrast ratio, and five roles were corrected because the accepted wireframe values failed WCAG AA in light mode.
---
