-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.046271+00:00

The canonical theme carries two names for one colour role: signal is the v2 name and accentSecondary is kept as a v1 alias, with identical values in all three modes. Every consumer that reads accentSecondary works, which is exactly why the alias will outlive the migration unless someone retires it deliberately.
