needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:49ba726c-031e-4a01-839f-11a76a8bf009] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.173590+00:00
-> ABOUT [node:d2844438-9992-4e20-bfb5-fa615a906574] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.173590+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.173590+00:00
-> ABOUT [node:f96f62c3-d72a-4c40-8e16-57278ca1f302] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.173590+00:00

Slideshow is declared as an entry in a layout's card list but the schema then spends a paragraph saying it is not a card: it renders nothing in its own grid slot, its span is ignored, at most one may exist per layout, and it may not be nested in a carousel, a card grid or the sidebar. The type system says card and the semantics say layout controller, so every one of those rules has to be enforced by hand at validation time rather than falling out of the shape.
---
[node:f1d7ef56-555a-4a33-90fa-8762fee9914f]
type: constraint
tier: mid-term
path: /artifact/the-sidebar-s-collapse-behaviour-is-deci
created_at: 2026-09-08T13:42:46.308554+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:7e1fbadd-ddd7-496e-89e4-0f835b3753a8] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.308554+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:e12ca220-5f82-4226-a2eb-9964701f03c4] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.308554+00:00
-> ABOUT [node:f96f62c3-d72a-4c40-8e16-57278ca1f302] @ 2026-09-08T13:42:46.308554+00:00

The sidebar's collapse behaviour is decided by the device shape rather than by preference: permanent in horizontal layouts, collapsible in vertical ones, and always collapsible on a phone. The phone case is a schema const, not a default - it cannot be overridden - because a permanent sidebar on a 375px screen leaves nothing for the cards it sits beside.
---
